Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Spread Helper 0.3.2 - GEREKLI: yardimci imzasizdir; CEP 12 (Premiere Pro 25.x / 26.x) gelistirici kipinde yuklenir.
; Adobe CEP 12 Cookbook ("Debugging Unsigned Extensions"): HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Adobe\CSXS.12, PlayerDebugMode (string) = "1"
; Geri almak icin: regedit ile bu degeri sil ya da "0" yap.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Adobe\CSXS.12]
"PlayerDebugMode"="1"
